      q: `<p>At a software firm, the QA lead, Deepa, blamed the development team for a failed release during a call with the client. Since then, developers have stopped replying to QA tickets, and Deepa says they are "hiding bugs". The next release is in one week. The project manager, Anita, wants to analyse the case. Write out the handout's seven analysis questions in order and, for each, the specific question you would ask about this firm. You do not need to answer them.</p>`,
